.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mailbox 1  "mailbox " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
mailbox \- Manage mailboxes using the shared API
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBmailbox\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Manage mailboxes using the shared API.
.PP
A mailbox is a message container.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mailbox\-list(1)
Shared API to list mailboxes for the active account
.TP
mailbox\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
